// cube faces: 0=top,1=bottom,2=front,3=back,4=left,5=right
// orientation stored as: which face index is at each position
// rotation when moving right: top->right, right->bottom, bottom->left, left->top
// rotation when moving left: top->left, left->bottom, bottom->right, right->top  
// rotation when moving down: top->front, front->bottom, bottom->back, back->top
